426
00:31:12,494 --> 00:31:13,168
It got one more.

427
00:31:13,248 --> 00:31:13,888
It addressed that.

428
00:31:14,048 --> 00:31:16,036
Now it's approved by those AI review bots.

429
00:31:16,368 --> 00:31:22,596
All of those layers could have been more back and forth between me and the agents doing the review and my agent writing the code.

430
00:31:22,768 --> 00:31:27,108
